    <item>
      <title>BookCrawler — 웹 크롤링부터 블로그 자동 발행까지</title>
      <link>https://Han-think.github.io/posts/dataset/bookcrawler-pipeline/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 10:00:00 +0900</pubDate>
      <guid>https://Han-think.github.io/posts/dataset/bookcrawler-pipeline/</guid>
      <description>&lt;a href=&#34;https://Han-think.github.io/downloads/bookcrawler.zip&#34; class=&#34;dl-btn&#34; download&gt;
  ⬇ BookCrawler 소스 다운로드 (ZIP · 전체 파이프라인)
&lt;/a&gt;

&lt;h2 id=&#34;개요&#34;&gt;개요&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;books.toscrape.com&lt;/code&gt;에서 책 정보를 수집해 Hugo 블로그에 &lt;strong&gt;5분 간격으로 자동 발행&lt;/strong&gt;하는 파이프라인입니다.&lt;br&gt;
스크레이핑 → 변환 → Git 자동화 → 스케줄링까지 전 과정을 Python 모듈로 구성했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;파이프라인-구조&#34;&gt;파이프라인 구조&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;run.py  (진입점 · argparse)
  │
  ├─ pipeline.py  (오케스트레이터)
  │    ├─ PHASE 1 ─ scraper.py       ← requests + BeautifulSoup4
  │    │             queue_manager.py ← books.json / queue.json 관리
  │    │
  │    └─ PHASE 2 ─ scheduler.py     ← schedule 라이브러리 (5분 주기)
  │                  converter.py    ← dict → Hugo .md (TOML front matter)
  │                  publisher.py    ← Hugo build + git push (subprocess)
  │
  └─ config.py  (URL, 경로, 상수 중앙 관리)
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;모듈별-역할&#34;&gt;모듈별 역할&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;scraperpy--수집-requests--beautifulsoup4&#34;&gt;scraper.py — 수집 (requests + BeautifulSoup4)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; scraper &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; scrape_books_with_details
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;books &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; scrape_books_with_details(pages&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;, limit&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# [{&amp;#34;title&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;...&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;price&amp;#34;: 12.34, &amp;#34;rating&amp;#34;: 4, &amp;#34;category&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;Mystery&amp;#34;, ...}, ...]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;page-{N}.html&lt;/code&gt; 목록 → &lt;code&gt;article.product_pod&lt;/code&gt; 파싱&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;상세 페이지 → 카테고리(breadcrumb), 설명, UPC 추출&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;requests.Session&lt;/code&gt; 재사용 + &lt;code&gt;time.sleep(1)&lt;/code&gt; (예의 바른 크롤링)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;converterpy--변환&#34;&gt;converter.py — 변환&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; converter &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; save_markdown
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; datetime &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; datetime, timezone, timedelta
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;path &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; save_markdown(book, pub_date&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;datetime&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;now(timezone(timedelta(hours&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;))))
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# → content/posts/book-reviews/2026-05-27_a-light-in-the-attic.md&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hugo TOML front matter 생성:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>크롤링은 어떻게 페이지를 넘어가나 — 명령어와 구조로 읽는 웹 수집</title>
      <link>https://Han-think.github.io/posts/dataset/how-crawling-works/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 09:00:00 +0900</pubDate>
      <guid>https://Han-think.github.io/posts/dataset/how-crawling-works/</guid>
      <description>겁나 살벌해 보이는 웹 크롤링. 사실 URL 규칙 하나 잡으면 끝입니다. 페이지네이션 구조부터 데이터 저장까지, 코드가 실제로 뭘 하는지 단계별로 읽어봅니다.</description>
